-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 30 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  30  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">WPN_Mace_Deva_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_Mace_Deva_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:WPN_Mace_Deva_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c0fb0a11-1f29-470c-a95b-102377ef2356</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c0fb0a11-1f29-470c-a95b-102377ef2356\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c0fb0a11-1f29-470c-a95b-102377ef2356\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concussive_Smash\" title=\"Concussive Smash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/40px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/60px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/80px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concussive Smash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp/40px-Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Concussive_Smash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concussive_Smash\" title=\"Concussive Smash\">Concussive Smash</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Hit an enemy with all your might to deal damage and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Daze</a> them. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Equipped by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/25px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/38px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/50px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deva\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png/25px-Portrait_Deva.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Deva.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deva\" title=\"Deva\">Deva</a> summoned from <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\">Planar Ally: Deva</a> as well as other instances of Devas in game</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>As of Patch 8/Hotfix 31, this weapon can be obtained using a mouse and keyboard on PC with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c8JDT_DdD0s&amp;t=38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"the following steps\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c8JDT_DdD0s&amp;t=38\">the following steps</a></span>:\n<ul><li>Summon a <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\">Planar Ally: Deva</a>.</li>\n<li>Open its inventory.</li>\n<li>Click the preview icon, located below the character.</li>\n<li>Click and hold the weapon. (Caution: The weapon slot only appears for a few frames.)</li>\n<li>Open the party inventory (or, for example, have the <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> from camp inventory already open) and place the weapon in an empty inventory slot.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The following also works as of Patch 8/Hotfix 31, and is possible on all platforms:<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Needs verification.\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup>\n<ul><li>Summon a <a href=\"/wiki/Planar_Ally:_Deva\" title=\"Planar Ally: Deva\">Planar Ally: Deva</a>.</li>\n<li>Place a weapon with the \"<a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Items_consumable_by_Gale\" title=\"List of Items consumable by Gale\">Can be consumed by Gale</a>\" tag on the ground.</li>\n<li>As the Deva, select the weapon and select the 'use' option. This will equip the weapon.</li>\n<li>Pickpocket the mace from the Deva's inventory.</li></ul></li>\n<li>As of Patch 7/Hotfix 29, this weapon was obtainable using a <b>controller</b> on PC or console with the following steps:\n<ul><li>Kill a Deva summoned by <a href=\"/wiki/Castigated_By_Divinity_(Condition)\" title=\"Castigated By Divinity (Condition)\">Castigated by Divinity</a> and Pick Up its body.</li>\n<li>Open any character's inventory, press A/X on their melee main-hand equipment slot, and unequip their current weapon in the weapon list that appears.</li>\n<li>Still in the weapon list, press A/X on the Deva Mace to equip it to the currently selected character.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202411\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.117 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.122 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3861/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54429/4194304 bytes\nTempla